# Two real clients, side B: a Kargan waits in the world for the Aydor of side A
# (two_aydor.voscript), sees it with its name and race, sees it come closer, walks a few metres
# itself, and sees it despawn when it leaves the world.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m7_kargan
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.kargan
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.3
clickon create.name
text Kargaci
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle 1800
waitfor world+remotes1 3600
scene expectremote Aydinli 1
expecttext world.rtt Oyuncular: 1
scene expectremotemesh Aydinli
scene markremote Aydinli
scene log
screenshot b01_sees_aydor.png
# The Aydor walks over: its position changes and it ends up next to us.
waitfor world+remotemoved 1800
waitfor world+remotenear8 1800
scene camera 200 28 10
wait 30
scene log
screenshot b02_aydor_arrived.png
# Walk a few metres so side A sees us move.
scene walkrel 3 3
waitfor world+moving 120
waitfor world+nodest+standing 600
scene expectremote Aydinli 1
# Side A leaves the world: its entity despawns here.
waitfor world+remotes0 3600
scene expectnoremote Aydinli
wait 10
screenshot b03_aydor_gone.png
scene log
quit